{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/122690","id":4331220453,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABAikt5Q","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122690","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122690.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122690.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122690","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/122690/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/122690/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122690/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/a7b586829d1d59a614994e4f4af3d648260ab3e3","number":122690,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"[Core]: Make `get_object_class_name_or_empty` return reference for use in typed containers","user":{"login":"NoctemCat","id":22471296,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNDcxMjk2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22471296?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoctemCat","html_url":"https://github.com/NoctemCat","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoctemCat/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoctemCat/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoctemCat/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoctemCat/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoctemCat/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoctemCat/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoctemCat/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoctemCat/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoctemCat/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\nCurrently `TypedArray<T>` and `TypedDictionary<K, V>` always create a new `StringName` on their creation, this PR makes them use either a reference from the class or an empty reference. It's needed to avoid the global mutex that is being used when non-empty `StringName` is created.\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\n`get_object_class_name_or_empty` is only used for typed containers, so this should be pretty safe. And as it is a `StringName` it can be easily turned into `String` on site if anyone needs the original behaviour.\r\n\r\nAlso previously it didn't create new `StringName` here\r\nCode in 4.5.2:\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/6ce3de25aa58466e14ef354703ba8d9791a417da/core/variant/typed_array.h#L50-L51\r\n\r\nCode in 4.6:\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/89cea143987d564363e15d207438530651d943ac/core/variant/typed_array.h#L43-L44\r\n\r\nIt's being auto created by the `StringName` ctor:\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/6ce3de25aa58466e14ef354703ba8d9791a417da/core/variant/array.h#L189","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097966,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc5NjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:core","name":"topic:core","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":15520464,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A7NLQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/25","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25/labels","number":25,"state":"open","title":"4.8","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubuse